<view class="page">
  <view class="page-heading"><text class="eyebrow">DATA &amp; EXPORT</text><text class="page-title">让每月工时一目了然</text><text class="page-desc">选择统计月份，汇总并导出工时记录。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card state-card"><text class="state-title">正在加载表单</text><text class="helper">正在获取月度记录与提交人数。</text></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loadError}}" class="card state-card"><text class="state-title">加载失败</text><text class="helper">{{loadError}}</text><button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="loadForms">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!forms.length}}" class="card state-card"><text class="state-title">还没有月度表单</text><text class="helper">创建表单并收集记录后，即可在这里统计和导出。</text><button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="goCreate">创建月度表单</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card"><text class="form-label field-first">选择统计月份</text><picker range="{{formNames}}" value="{{formIndex}}" bindchange="onForm" disabled="{{calculating || downloading}}"><view class="picker"><text>{{formNames[formIndex]}}</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></picker><view class="export-overview"><view><text class="count">{{forms[formIndex].count}}</text><text class="helper">已提交人数</text></view><text class="badge">{{forms[formIndex].statusLabel}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="section-title">汇总与导出</text><text class="helper action-help">月度统计会处理所有已截止的表单；Excel 导出仅针对上方选中的月份。</text><button class="btn-secondary" loading="{{calculating}}" disabled="{{calculating || downloading}}" bindtap="calculate">{{calculating ? '正在统计' : '执行月度统计'}}</button><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{downloading}}" disabled="{{calculating || downloading}}" bindtap="exportXlsx">{{downloading ? '正在生成文件' : '导出 Excel 文件'}}</button></view>
  </block>
  <view class="card result-card" wx:if="{{lastResult}}"><text class="badge">导出成功</text><text class="result-title">{{lastResult.filename}}</text><text class="helper">下载链接已生成，可复制后在浏览器中打开。</text><button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="preview">复制下载链接</button></view>
  <text class="footer-note">CPRO · 月度工时管理</text>
</view>
